Modifications for LinkRetro
---------------------------
  * Interface re-branded and re-themed for linkretro.com (logo, palette, type, controls)
  * Update page rebuilt: USB and Bluetooth methods, built-in firmware list,
    automatic firmware selection and "latest version" marking
  * Full firmware images unpacked at build time into app-only images for the
    wireless update path
  * Bluetooth and USB connection lifecycle hardened (link release, retry policy)
  * Upstream remote version check ("Upgrade Available") removed
  * Preset list bundled with the site (34 presets, no runtime downloads)
  * Upstream CNAME record (blueretro.io) removed from the project
  * Built for the /tools/blueretro-webconfig/ sub-path (build-time base path)

